# PSR-4b-host-imports-3 — careful shrink (4 → 3)

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Move urban surface exposure into `http/configure-*` product-adapter | Yes |
| Finance ledger exclusive denali imports | **No** |
| Migrate-canonical denali schema constants | **No** |
| Equipment icon settings contract | **No** (keep — documented platform contract) |

## Changes

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| `apps/api/src/exposure/resolve-urban-surface-exposure.ts` | `apps/api/src/http/configure-urban-surface-exposure.ts` |

Path rename is intentional: smoke/host-source ratchet already treats
`/http/configure-*` as approved product adapters (same cohort as
`configure-urban-http-host.ts`). Urban exposure was only wired from that adapter.

Callers / docs / guards updated to the new path.

## Metrics

| Metric | Before | After |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| Host-source branded files | 4 | **3** |
| Product defaults | 0 | 0 |

Remaining host-source: migrate-canonical, equipment-icon contract, finance ledger exclusive.

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Host-source ceiling ≤3 | required |
| Urban exposure contract path tests green | required |
| No product-default regression | required |
